You have READ-ONLY tools (read_file,list_files,search,codegraph_query,resolve_test_file,codeline_facts,git_state,check_anti_patterns,resolve_package_symbol,dependency_contract,dependency_available,scan_secrets). Use them: open the manifests, find the modules
